# WoW addon AI — security

When writing or editing addon code, follow `06-notes/addon-dev/security-and-trust.md`.

## Must

- Never `loadstring` / `RunScript` on chat, addon messages, or untrusted SavedVariables
- Hook Blizzard with `hooksecurefunc` / `HookScript` only — do not replace `_G` Blizzard functions
- Check `InCombatLockdown()` before mutating secure/protected frames; queue for `PLAYER_REGEN_ENABLED`
- Never store secret values (or functions/userdata) in SavedVariables
- Validate and version addon-message payloads; rate-limit chat sends; require opt-in for automation
- Prefix globals and frame names; no credential phishing UI
- Verify APIs against the target client docs — do not invent functions

## Must not

- Claim secure/combat bypasses or fake hardware events
- Auto-spam chat from combat or untrusted triggers
- Copy Classic Era CLEU/secret-free patterns onto Forever or Midnight without migration notes
